		"text": "Bosses shrug off crowd control: stuns last {boss_stun}% as long, shoves move them {boss_push}% as far, most resist half of every slow, and lane shocks burn only {shock_boss}% of their health per second. Leaking one costs a lot of shields."},
	"cc_immune": {"title": "Crowd-control immunity", "category": "effects", "see": ["expose", "stun"],
		"text": "Ramparts ignore slows, stuns and shoves, and the Colossus can't be stunned. Exposing them removes the immunity for a while."},
	"cloak": {"title": "Cloak and reveal", "category": "effects", "see": ["mark", "disrupt"],
